  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the &#x201c;Early Reintegration Model in Productive Environments&#x201d; with Former FARC-EP Members in Colombia - Phase V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to the reincorporation process of former Revolutionary Armed Forces of Colombia- People&#x2019;s Army (FARC-EP in Spanish) members through the implementation of the productive environments models in the agricultural, agro-industrial, and/or service sectors in Colombia. This project will benefit 210 former combatants currently in the reincorporation process. The above will be achieved through the strengthening of their abilities, capacities, and skills, as part of their process to achieve their economic sustainability. The location of the productive environments is defined based on a survey conducted by the Agency for Reincorporation and Normalization that determines the interest of the target population in the identified training lines.</narrative>
  </description>
